sentences.text:
India This Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of seeking the following relief;
"to issue a writ order or direction more particulerly one in of the the nature of Writ of Mandamus declaring the action respondents in laying down pipeline through the petitioner's land admeasuring an extent of Ac.2.00 out of Ac. 24.15 cents in Sy.No.413 of Papasanipalli Village, Madakasira Mandal, Satya Sai District, without following the due process of law and the procedure contemplated under Act 30 of 2013 as illegal,
arbitrary and violative of Articles 21, 300-A of the Constitution of India and consequently direct the respondents herein not to lay the pipeline through the petitioner's land admeasuring an extent of Ac.2.00 out of Ac.24.15 cents in Sy.No.413 of Papasanipalli Village, Madakasira Mandal, Satya Sai District without following the due process of law and the procedure contemplated under Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency under Land Acquisition Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013 and to pass such other order or orders... "
